  "summary": "Tracing every interface described in the specification against the drawing shows a faithful match: the NFC I2C lines (NFC_SDA/SCL/INT) each carry a 10 kΩ pull-up (R1/R2/R3) to VCC and land on U3 pins 5/3/4 (SDA/SCL/FD) with VOUT tied to VCC and C18 left as '??' (a documented known limitation, not an anomaly); the SSD1306 is strapped BS0=GND, BS1=VCC, BS2=GND with D0→DISP_SCL and D1/D2 tied→DISP_SDA, R4/R6/R7 as 10 kΩ pull-ups, and the charge-pump/bias parts C7=2.2 µF, C11=4.7 µF, C12/C13=1 µF, R5=390 kΩ, VBAT→VCC all matching; the TSC block has C14=22 nF on TSC_G2_IO4 and R8=1 kΩ in series to the A2 BTN electrode with SHLD→GND; and the Tag-Connect J1, NRST/R10, BOOT0→GND and the VCC/GND decoupling set all agree with the spec. No short, bridge, wrong value, wrong component type, or polarity deviation is supported by the drawing, so no anomaly is reported."
}

